hat's a survivable worst case. And it's not even a lie or a half-truth; it's just the smallest true thing.\n\nOne thing though: you called yourself \"a rude person.\" Is that how you think he sees you?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Worst case he's confused — that's a survivable worst case. And it's not even a lie or a half-truth; it's just the smallest true thing.\n\nOne thing though: you called yourself \"a rude person.\" Is that how you think he sees you?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":7496,"promptTokens":1671,"completionTokens":116,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:26:29"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":45,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"2bbb799da56945dc9d1df34b3d9a008f","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":8.040723446144978E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b0503e5beecf50d38480c93","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795490789991,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:26:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b0503e5beecf50d38480c93","chatId":"f1ccfefde56e44fdbfd6f768822c221e","sessionId":null,"userId":130788,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"\"im not mad at you.\" thats already true and it doesnt say anything about money or my mom or any of it\n\nhe can take that any way he wants and worst case hes just confused about why a rude person is un-rude all of a sudden","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regener